Package: runoutSIM
Title: Landslide Runout and Connectivity Simulation with Random Walks
Version: 1.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("Jason", "Goetz", email = "jgoetz@wlu.ca", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jia", "Huang", email = "huan7147@mylaurier.ca", role = c("ctb")))
Maintainer: Jason Goetz <jgoetz@wlu.ca>
Description: Geospatial tools for simulating mass-movement runout using random 
    walk methods on digital elevation models (DEMs) and assessing connectivity to 
    spatial features. Methods described in Goetz (2026) <doi:10.5194/gmd-19-5709-2026>.
